  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anit/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">길들이기(Taming)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anit_1/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">테이밍스킬수치표</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anit_2/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">주요스폰장소</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anil/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">동물지식(Animal Lore)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_vet/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">동물붕대힐(Veterinary)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_he/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">목동술(Herding)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/1.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">유니콘의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">숭고함의 \n                            게이트를 선택해서 나오는 길에 보이는 숲 전체에 분포 \n                                        되어 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">테임후 게이트로 들어가셔셔 \n                            다른 \n                            서버구역으로 유니콘을 이동하셔야 유니콘이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">다시 리젠됩니다. \n                                        유니콘을 테임 하실려면 테이머가 여성 캐릭이어야 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">카르마가 너무 \n                            낮으믄 주위의 요정들이 \n                            공격을 가하므로 염두해두시길..</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Spidercave/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Spider \n                                        Cave(거미굴)</b></font></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/2.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">나이트메어의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일쉐나 \n                                        정직게이트를 지나&nbsp;기린통로에 가시면&nbsp;1마리가 \n                                        젠이 되는것을 보실 수</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있습니다. \n                                        산성엘리가 근처에 있으므로 뒤로 빼신 \n                                        후 편하게 테임 하시는것이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좋습니다. \n                                        펠루카의 </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20071118171210/http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/Wind%20City.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Wind \n                            City(윈드시티)</b></font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">의 \n                                        워프지역</font></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이나 \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">펠루카의 \n                                        </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20071118171210/http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/Terathan%20Keep.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Terathan \n                                        Keep(테라탄킵)</b></font></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">에서도 \n                                        스폰됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Kirin/\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Kirin \n                            Passage(기린통로)</b></font></a></span><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/3.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">기린의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일쉐나 \n                                        정직게이트를 지나&nbsp;기린통로에 가시면&nbsp;맵상에 \n                                        기린의 그림이 우측하단에 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">그려져 \n                                        있습니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">해당 \n                                        장소에 스폰이 되며 기린을 테임 하실려면 \n                                        테이머가 남성 캐릭이어야 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Kirin/\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Kirin \n                            Passage(기린통로)</b></font></a></span><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">참조</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/4.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">스웜프드래곤의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일쉐나 \n                                        정직 \n                            게이트를 선택하시면 좌상단에 위습던전이 있습니다. \n                                        그 길을 지나</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">늪지대까지 \n                                        가시면 스웜프 드래곤을 만나실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">브리타니아대륙의 \n                                        트린식 하단에 있는 늪지대에서도 스폰됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Wisp/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Wisp(위습던전)</b></font></span></a><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/5.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">탈 \n                                        수 있는 라마와 광폭오스타드, 색 오스타드&nbsp;스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">잃어버린대륙(T2A)지역의 \n                                        델루시아마을에서 죽음의도시지역을 지나 \n                                        길을 따라</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">바다쪽 \n                                        까지 올라 가시면 숲 근처 전 지역에 다양하게 \n                                        분포 되어 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20071118171210/http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/City%20of%20dead.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>City \n                            of the Dead(죽음의도시)</b></font></a></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/6.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">드래곤,드레이크의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">브리타니아대륙의 \n                                        데스타드 던전에 주로 상주하며 히스로스섬의 \n                                        데몬템플등지에도</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">흔히 \n                                        볼 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Destard/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Destard(데스타드)</b></font></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/7.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">화이트웜의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">잃어버린대륙(T2A)지역의 \n                                        아이스던전에 깊숙한 지역에 상주하며 \n                                        주변의 다양한</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">몬스터들이 \n                                        있으므로 처리 후 테임하시는게 좋습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">화이트웜은 \n                                        리얼화이트웜과 좌측에 보이는 보통 화이트웜이 \n                                        있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20071118171210/http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/Ice%20Dungeon.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Ice \n                                        Dungeon(아이스던전)</b></font></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/8.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">자이언트비틀의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">브리타니아대륙의 \n                                        개미굴에 상주하며 개미굴안에 있는 물가에서 \n                                        자주 보입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">바로 \n                                        테임을 할 수 없으므로 체력의 약 90%를 \n                                        소진 시킨 후 테임 시도를 하셔야 합니다. \n                                        특히 공격을 받게되면 비틀의 움직임이 \n                                        빨라지므로 주의가 필요합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">남쪽입구에 \n                                        있는&nbsp;물가에서 주로 테임을 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : UO.퀘스트란의 </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Spidercave/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Spider \n                                        Cave(거미굴)</b></font></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/9.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">파이어비틀의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">SE지역에 \n                                        있는 요모츠마인던전에 스폰됩니다. 근처에 \n                                        요모츠엘더,워리어등이 있으므로 파이어 \n                                        비틀만 빼내어 테임하시는것이 필요합니다. \n                                        바로 테임을 할 수 없으므로 체력의 약 \n                                        90%를 소진 시킨 후 테임 시도를 하셔야 \n                                        합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20071118171210/http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/T_mines.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Yomotsu \n                            Mines(마인던전)</b></font></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/10.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">세비지릿지백의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일쉐나 \n                                        자비 게이트를 선택하시어 엑소더스던전쪽으로 \n                                        가시는 길에 지도를 보시면</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">세비지릿지백과 \n                                        세비지서식지에 스폰됩니다. 해당 지역은 \n                                        세비지가 많으므로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">페인트(</span></font><a href=\"/site/skill_knowhow/uo_knowhow_addon_5/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>세비지의도구</b></font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">)</font></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">를 \n                                        몸에 바르시고 테임을 하시면 편합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Exodus/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Exodus(엑소더스던전)</b></font></span></a><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/11.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">룬비틀의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">SE지역에 \n                                        있는 토구노섬의 이사무지역에 스폰됩니다. \n                                        게이트를 타고 들어가서</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">길을 \n                                        따라 올라가시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20071118171210/http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/Tokuno_Isamu.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Tokuno(토쿠노섬-Isamu)</b></font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">\n</font></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"96%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/animal/12.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\">히류의 \n                                        스폰장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">SE지역에 \n                                        있는 토구노섬의 이사무지역에 스폰됩니다. \n                                        게이트를 타고 들어가서</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">길을 \n                                        따라 올라가시면 됩니다. 히류보다 약한 \n                                        </span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Lesse \n                            Hiryu(레서히류)</font></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가 \n                                        있고 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">여러가지 \n                                        색을 가지고 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">관련지도</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        : 몬스터&amp;던전란의 </span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20071118171210/http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/Tokuno_Isamu.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"green\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Tokuno(토쿠노섬-Isamu)</b></font></a></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;참조</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written By Forg</span></b></font></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n",
